2a. Permission-request draft (copy, fill in, send; short by design)
-------------------------------------------------------------------
Send to: [rights holder for ASL Citizen — Microsoft Research; and the S3D /
WLASL authors]. Subject: request to redistribute model weights derived from
your data.

    We trained a small sign-recognition model on data derived from ASL Citizen
    (and, separately, WLASL). We would like to include the trained weight files
    (SHA-256: <hash>) and their label vocabulary in a public hackathon
    submission and repository release. Please confirm in writing whether (a)
    redistribution of these derived weights is permitted, (b) any attribution
    or licence text must accompany them, and (c) whether commercial use is
    excluded. Until we have your written confirmation we are treating these
    files as private and will not publish them.

Record the reply, its date, and the exact scope it grants in this NOTICE
before shipping any affected artifact.

