3. Datasets and derived data — non-redistributable
------------------------------------------------------------------------
* WLASL — C-UDA licence (academic / non-commercial). Clips, splits, and
  landmark/array caches stay outside Git and outside any submission ZIP.
* ASL Citizen (Microsoft Research licence, non-commercial, no redistribution).
  Clips and any per-participant rows carry research-only context.

The tracked per-participant evidence files
(``evaluation/asl_citizen_predictions.csv`` with raw ``P15``-style participant
IDs and the ``per_signer`` dicts in
``evaluation/asl_citizen_{ptq,qat}_results.json``) are LOCAL RESEARCH INPUTS.
Their removal or visibility is a separate owner decision, out of scope here.
Publish-safe copies are generated only into
``evaluation/device/compliance_final/publish/`` by
``scripts/release/sanitize_export.py``, which drops or keyed-pseudonymises the
participant linkage and refuses to emit anything still carrying a raw
participant token or private path. The pseudonymisation key never ships.

